title: "Customize the Docs"
description: "Turn the included pages into documentation for your product"
order: 2
---

## Start with the first successful outcome

Rewrite Getting Started around the shortest path to a visible result. Show the exact command, expected response, and one recovery step for the most common failure.

## Replace examples with product language

Search the example copy before launch:

```bash
rg -n "example|replace" content/docs
```

Remove pages that do not help a reader make a decision or complete a task.

## Verify the public surface

Check the rendered page, raw Markdown, and discovery index:

```bash
curl --fail http://localhost:8090/docs
curl --fail http://localhost:8090/docs.md
curl --fail http://localhost:8090/llms.txt
```
